{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id671881704?l=en"}, "name":{"label":"Bilibala balaba"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-09T23:36:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.68.31"}, "id":{"label":"13941844869"}, "title":{"label":"Poor app performance"}, "content":{"label":"The app keeps crashing and force‑closing during use. However, the bank requires certain functions—such as time deposit transactions—to be completed during their working hours, when the app is not functioning properly.\n\nIn addition, the chatbot is unable to understand or address this issue and cannot provide meaningful support. The only alternatives offered are visiting the bank in person or calling customer service, but the hotline is not easy to locate, and it is difficult to make such calls during working hours.\n\nOverall, the experience has been extremely frustrating.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=1164066737&l=en&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
